      "answer": "Among the North America West Event Nexus accounts, the following are dealing with taxonomy/search semantics problems: Arcadia Cloudworks, BlueHarbor Logistics, CedarWind Renewables, HelioFab Systems, Pacific Health Network, and Pioneer Freight Solutions. Their support tickets report issues such as search relevance degradation, low-relevance matches, missed dedupe matches, and misfiring runbook triggers after taxonomy changes.\n\nThe accounts dealing with duplicate-action problems are Helix Assemblies Inc., LedgerBright Analytics, LedgerPeak Software, MedLogix Distribution, Peregrine Logistics Group, and Pioneer Grid Retail LLC. Their issues include workflow deduplication drift during cross-system handoffs, duplicate incidents, duplicate runbook executions, and idempotency key mismatches following post-acquisition systems consolidation.\n\nNo evidence indicates that any North America West Event Nexus account is simultaneously facing both taxonomy/search semantics problems and duplicate-action problems; each account is classified under one problem type only [art_90991e25335f, art_8b0063fbb3cb, art_10f7e8b72e09, art_9345d5653840, art_4eccfd9dcf29, art_3ba29fe1e026, art_0ac4efa5a0ff, art_8478ccd5b200, art_2f780acc1f96, art_87b096c2c2d3, art_0927b1cbb7f4, art_f64972a66eeb].",
